ossess mystical properties. The spring emanates crystal-clear water, shimmering with an otherworldly iridescence that sparkles even in the dimmest light."},{"id":"marker3","name":"Kokoku — iron mining town","legend":"Kokoku is a mining town of 1622 people just nearby the iron mine."},{"id":"marker4","name":"Algan — salt mining town","legend":"Algan is a mining town of 1656 people just nearby the salt mine."},{"id":"marker5","name":"Alcoro — gold mining town","legend":"Alcoro is a mining town of 1713 people just nearby the gold mine."},{"id":"marker6","name":"Fecorma — copper mining town","legend":"Fecorma is a mining town of 3692 people just nearby the copper mine."},{"id":"marker7","name":"Oakburgh Bridge","legend":"A weathered bridge spans over the Camble River near Oakburgh."},{"id":"marker8","name":"Mustti Bridge","legend":"An old crossing of the Kozokev River, rarely used since the old waypoints crumbled."},{"id":"marker9","name":"The Lucky Inn","legend":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious roasted pottage with shiny gin is served here."},{"id":"marker10","name":"The Purple Sheep","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious fried pie with amber tequila is served here."},{"id":"marker11","name":"The Bright Crane","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious stewed beef with green rom is served here."},{"id":"marker12","name":"The Amber Antelope","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious braised cabbage with light milk is served here."},{"id":"marker13","name":"Sigosthian Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker14","name":"Stedish Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker15","name":"Kiambe Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Mombazian Expedition. \r\nDate: October 3, 1429 Cadana Era."},{"id":"marker16","name":"Lopsetso Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Tacury War. \r\nDate: January 31, 1387 Cadana Era."},{"id":"marker17","name":"Berkh Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Yazan Conflict. \r\nDate: July 4, 1043 Cadana Era."},{"id":"marker18","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=6903663052995\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=6903663052995\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker19","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=6903663052539\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=6903663052539\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker20","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=6903663052439\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=6903663052439\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker21","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=6903663052052\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=6903663052052\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker22","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=6903663051864\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=6903663051864\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker23","name":"Orse Monster","legend":"Tipplers say a relic monster of 10 m long inhabits Orse Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker24","name":"Pewich Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 21 m long."},{"id":"marker25","name":"Delsan Roc","legend":"Legends speak of a great Roc who inhabits Delsan hills and keeps the region at bay."},{"id":"marker26","name":"Yene Ogoon Roc","legend":"Locals speak of a giant Roc who inhabits Yene Ogoon hills and terrorizes the region."},{"id":"marker27","name":"Yalkan Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Turchian Forefathers."},{"id":"marker28","name":"Urerekhgol Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Cult of the Secret."},{"id":"marker29","name":"Uxbridleby Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Angshire Shamanism."},{"id":"marker30","name":"Grotri Badgers","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker31","name":"Albeyli Cats","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker32","name":"Penknethes Wolverines","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker33","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker34","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker35","name":"Tsogt Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> ጸ ጰገጰሐተለገቀቀገበዐነሀአመፀዘለተደኀየ ኀአተጰጸለአከጠሠሐፈገአዐረተኀዘጰኀወ ሐሐፐፐነ  ጸረፐፈሐቀ በተቀዘገጰቀ  ነ</div>"},{"id":"marker36","name":"Darporton Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༉༢༹༘༩༊༹༑༺༙་༂༴༐༦༳༿༢༊༰༫༶༹༚༲༓༫༆༢༓༘༮༧༿༶༻༿༪༡༗༸</div>"},{"id":"marker37","name":"Ruined Stronghold","legend":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker38","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker39","name":"Ruined Stronghold","legend":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker40","name":"Orgos Archive","legend":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"id":"marker41","name":"Travelling Magical Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this magical circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker42","name":"Travelling Wonderous Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this wonderous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker43","name":"Marshesham Competition","legend":"Warriors from around the land gather for a competition of speed in Marshesham, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"id":"marker44","name":"Wildsaufen Fair","legend":"A fair is being held in Wildsaufen, with all manner of local and foreign goods and services on offer."},{"id":"marker45","name":"Minor Jetty","legend":"A small location along the Munslach River to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"id":"marker46","name":"Owls migration","legend":"A huge group of owls are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker47","name":"Bozkalokbe Cavern","legend":"The Bozkalokbe Cavern. Locals claim that it is a good spot to hid treasure."},{"id":"marker48","name":"Halterling Necropolis","legend":"An eerie necropolis where nature intertwines with death. Overgrown tombstones are entwined by thorny vines, and mournful spirits wander among the fading petals of once-vibrant flowers."},{"id":"marker49","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/3714\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker50","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/1359\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker51","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/4248\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker52","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/2370\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker53","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/506\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"}]
